  "body_html": "<p>¿Cómo estás?</p><p>Soy Aina y esto es Think&amp;Hack.</p><p>Hoy quiero hablarte de lo que nadie dice en las ponencias sobre implementación de IA en empresas.</p><p>Si te interesa lo que pasa de verdad, suscríbete.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Suscríbete ahora&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Suscríbete ahora</span></a></p><div><hr></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"794\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:794,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:6565186,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Implementar IA en empresas&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/184108754?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Implementar IA en empresas\" title=\"Implementar IA en empresas\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0Cbn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a965111-0347-4417-bbdd-144ea12a09e6_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Implementar IA en empresas</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><p><strong>Implementar IA en empresas</strong></p><p>“En la cabeza de Juan.”</p><p>Esa frase se me quedó grabada. Alguien me explicaba dónde vivían los datos de su empresa: “Algunos en Excel, otros en la cabeza de Juan, que lleva aquí quince años.”</p><p>Y ahí me di cuenta de algo. Llevamos meses hablando de IA como si todas las empresas estuvieran preparadas para recibirla. Como si el único problema fuera elegir entre ChatGPT o Claude, decidir qué casos de uso priorizar, formar al equipo en prompts.</p><pre><code><em><strong>La mayoría no están tarde en IA</strong>. Están tarde en todo lo anterior.</em></code></pre><p>Esta semana escuché a Beatriz Sanz, responsable global de IA en EY, contar cómo han implementado IA para 400.000 empleados. Invirtieron 1.400 millones de dólares. Forman a su comité de dirección cada dos meses. Pasaron de 800 casos de uso a 8 y ahí empezó a funcionar. Cuando le preguntaron por dónde empezar con <em>IA en una pyme</em>, su primera respuesta no fue tecnología. <em>Fue: formación, datos, y un perfil técnico que lo entienda.</em></p><p><strong>Eso es exactamente lo que yo veo cada día.</strong></p><div><hr></div><h3><strong>Por qué tu empresa no esta preparada para la IA</strong></h3><p>No puedes construir una casa en un terreno que no has preparado.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png\" width=\"622\" height=\"147\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:147,&quot;width&quot;:622,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:12099,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/184108754?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jxrg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e0be8c1-c38a-478f-81ae-c06d53047f66_622x147.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>Cuando bajo a mi realidad, cuando hablo con equipos reales, me encuentro otra cosa. Departamentos que no tienen claro quién decide qué. Equipos donde el conocimiento crítico vive en tres cabezas que llevan veinte años y nunca lo han escrito. Sistemas que no se hablan entre ellos.</p><pre><code><em>No es un problema de IA. Es un problema de madurez digital básica.</em></code></pre><p>Y me frustra. Porque sé lo que hay que hacer. Lo tengo clarísimo. Pero entre el plan y la ejecución hay <strong>un pantano de deuda organizativa que nadie quiere nombrar</strong>.</p><p>Así que cuando alguien me pregunta “¿por dónde empiezo con IA?”, muchas veces mi respuesta no tiene nada que ver con IA.</p><ul><li><p>Empieza por documentar procesos.</p></li><li><p>Por saber dónde viven tus datos.</p></li><li><p>Por sacar el conocimiento de la cabeza de Juan y ponerlo en algún sitio donde no dependa de que Juan siga viniendo. O de que quiera seguir viniendo.</p></li></ul><p>Por sacar el conocimiento de la cabeza de Juan y ponerlo en algún sitio donde no dependa de que Juan siga viniendo.</p><p>Eso no sale en las keynotes. Pero es lo que separa a las empresas que ya pueden implementar (porque hicieron los deberes antes) de las que primero tienen que transformar lo básico (procesos, datos, cultura) antes de siquiera plantearse la IA.</p><p>¿Tu empresa está preparada para la IA o todavía tiene deberes pendientes de hace diez años?</p><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>Cuéntamelo. Siempre leo todo.</p></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:80,&quot;width&quot;:80,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1354,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/184108754?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KYv_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67c58daa-610b-4f97-9d9e-c7a7431183ba_80x80.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p><strong>Recomienda Think&amp;Hack</strong></p><p>Soy Aina. Responsable de IA generativa en Planeta.</p><p>Tres cosas rápidas:</p><p>🔄 <strong>Comparte:</strong> Reenvía esto a quien crea que implementar IA es solo elegir herramienta.</p><p>💬 <strong>Responde:</strong> ¿Tu empresa tiene los deberes hechos o estás en el pantano?</p><p>📩 <strong>Suscríbete:</strong> Si te han reenviado esto, únete aquí 👇</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Suscríbete ahora&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Suscríbete ahora</span></a></p><p></p>",
